  "id": "developmental-amnesia",
  "term": "developmental amnesia",
  "definition": "Developmental amnesia is amnesia that is present from development rather than starting in adulthood. In this source, it is described as involving memory impairment, while still allowing some close relationships to be formed and maintained.",
